<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      .container { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; font-size:
      .9em; line-height: 30px; } .header { text-align: center; background-color:
      #4CAF50; padding: 10px; color: white; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
      .content { padding: 20px; background-color: #fff; border-radius: 0 0 8px
      8px; } .content p { margin: 10px 0; } .footer { text-align: center;
      margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>

    <div class="container">
      <div>Dear {{user_name}},</div>
      <div>Your contract draft is ready for review.</div>
      <div>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <div>Click the link below to open the secure access page:</div>
            <a href="{{link}}">{{link}}</a>
          </li>
          <li>On the access page, click the ‘Get OTP’ button to request your
            One-Time Password.</li>
          <li>Check your email for the OTP we will send to you.</li>
          <li>Enter the OTP in the field provided on the access page and submit
            it.</li>
          <li>Once verified, you’ll be granted access to your contract draft.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <div>
          If you experience any issues or do not receive your OTP, please
          contact our support team for assistance.
        </div>
        <div>
          Thank you for your prompt attention.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div style="margin-bottom: -10px;">Best regards,</div>
        <div>AXIA Human Resources Department</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>